<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Recruitment & Applicant Tracking</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Master the complexity of talent acquisition through a structured, high-velocity digital 
            pipeline that ensures only the highest quality talent enters your organization.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Digital Requisition & Sourcing</h2>
        <p>
            Standardize the talent request process with a digital job requisition workflow. 
            Departmental managers can submit hiring requests for approval, including 
            definitive JD requirements and budgetary confirmation. Once approved, 
            the system automates the publishing of job advertisements to internal 
            portals, the Pindah corporate website, and integrated external boards like 
            LinkedIn, maximizing your candidate pool through centralized multi-channel 
            sourcing.
        </p>
        <p>
            Online application forms ensure structured data capture from the very first 
            interaction, allowing for high-speed initial screening and ranking of 
            candidates based on objective qualification criteria.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Structured Pipeline Orchestration</h2>
        <p>
            Move candidates through a transparent, stage-gated pipeline: Applied → Screened → 
            Interviewed → Offered → Hired. Every interaction is documented, with 
            integrated interview scheduling and automated email feedback capture for 
            stakeholders. This architectural focus eliminates'candidate black holes' 
            and ensures a professional, high-standard experience for everyone 
            interacting with your brand.
        </p>
        <p>
            Psychometric testing integration allows recruiters to request and archival 
            objective candidate assessments—inspired by specialized IPC Consultants' 
            methodologies—providing a robust evidential basis for final selection.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Offer Management & Secure Closing</h2>
        <p>
            Simplify the final mile of recruitment with automated offer letter generation. Final 
            approvals are captured digitally, and offers are transmitted to candidates 
            through a secure portal. Once accepted, the system initiates the background 
            check workflow and prepares the candidate data for seamless transition 
            into the onboarding and payroll modules, maintaining perfect data 
            integrity throughout the talent acquisition lifecycle.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

